<title>USA: CPI Corp, Kodak venture clears hurdle.</title>
<headline>CPI Corp, Kodak venture clears hurdle.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>CPI Corp said Thursday the Hart-Scott-Rodino antitrust waiting period relating to its photofinishing joint venture with Eastman Kodak Co has expired.</p>
<p>The transaction involves 550 of CPI's photofinishing minilabs.</p>
<p>CPI said it expects the remaining conditions to be satisfied in the first half of October.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
